        {
          "number": "896",
          "source_refs": ["p0277#6"],
          "task_count": 2,
          "method": "For unordered roots with sum S and separation d, roots are (S+d)/2 and (S-d)/2; product=(S^2-d^2)/4. Swapping root names leaves the coefficient unchanged.",
